#: ../../source/agents/docs/providers.md
msgid ""
"Bedrock console API key (base64 encoded, format: `ABSKQm...`). If IAM "
"credentials above are set, they take precedence."
msgstr ""
"Bedrock 콘솔 API 키(base64 인코딩, 형식: `ABSKQm...`). 위의 IAM 자격 증명이 설정된 "
